OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after fatal A39
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver of a tipper lorry has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,8,Fby dangerous driving after a fatal
OL,9,Fcollision on the A39, police have said.
OL,11,FPolice were called to a two-vehicle
OL,12,Fcrash involving a cream Volvo bulk
OL,13,Ftipper lorry and a grey Volkswagen Polo
OL,14,Fcar near Camelford, Cornwall, at about
OL,15,F10:05 GMT on Monday 2 November.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
