OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after fatal A39
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe car driver, a 57-year-old man from
OL,7,FNuneaton, was pronounced dead at the
OL,8,Fscene, Devon and Cornwall Police said.
OL,9,FThe tipper driver, a man in his 50s
OL,10,Ffrom St Austell, suffered minor
OL,11,Finjuries and was released on police
OL,12,Fbail while inquiries continued,
OL,13,Fofficers said.
OL,15,FThe road was shut in both directions
OL,16,Fbetween the junctions for Slaughter
OL,17,FBridge and Davidstow.
